# SECURITY

SERVIAUTO must use Supabase Row Level Security.

A shop must only be able to access its own:

- Customers
- Vehicles
- Inspections
- Diagnostics
- Parts
- Repair orders
- Estimates
- Invoices
- Payments
- Reports

Never expose:

- Supabase service-role keys
- API secrets
- Passwords
- OAuth secrets
- Supplier credentials

Secrets must be stored in secure environment variables or secret-management systems.

