# PRODUCTION GOAL

The final SERVIAUTO system should allow an automotive shop to:

1. Create a customer.
2. Add the customer's vehicle.
3. Enter or scan the VIN.
4. Display vehicle information and an available vehicle image.
5. Perform an inspection.
6. Import diagnostic results.
7. Identify DTCs.
8. Research the diagnostic problem.
9. Identify the suspected component.
10. Identify the replacement part.
11. Display the vehicle/component diagram.
12. Display step-by-step repair instructions.
13. Search technical information.
14. Watch relevant repair videos.
15. Build an estimate.
16. Obtain customer approval.
17. Create the repair order.
18. Assign the technician.
19. Complete the repair.
20. Create the invoice.
21. Record payment.
22. Follow up with the customer.
23. Store the complete vehicle history.
24. Generate business reports.

SERVIAUTO is intended to become a complete automotive repair-shop operating system.